# sweep-shadow-gpu.steps -- the dynamic lights' cube shadow maps through the
# SDL_GPU backend (-gpu) against GL (#340 P6b).
#
# Since P6b -gpu draws the maps: each layer-face of the D16 cube-map array is
# a depth-only render pass of its own (RG_FramebufferTextureLayer, ds.layer,
# never cycled), cleared through R_ClearBufferfv's GL_DEPTH arm, the world's
# and brush entities' runs one RG_DrawIndexed each (R_MultiDrawElements), the
# alias casters from their pose buffers (the ShadowPass pose rule), and the
# receivers sample it through a compare sampler, as GL does.
#
# THE TEST GAME.  tools/mk-shadow-testgame.py writes <basedir>/shadow: demo2
# with every torch tools/dlight-leak-check.sh's scenes need named (so each
# keeps its dynamic light), its cast-scene light and barrel and its recess
# barrel added, every monster dropped; and demo2m, the same map with the
# cast barrel an MD5 tombstone (a skeletal caster).  Nothing is committed:
# build it from the retail data each time.  The basedir must hold data1 as a
# directory.
#
# NOT HERE: the plan's frame 16, a mirror at r_dlight_occlusion 2.  No
# texture of demo2's that a rename can make a mirror (one plane, the world
# model's alone) shows a dynamic light's shadow from anywhere: the floor
# under the cast scene is rtex005, on 33 planes, and the lit wall's rtex022
# is a brush entity's too.  The mirror test game's demo1 has no dynamic
# light.  The mirror pass draws no maps (R_Shadow_Prepare is R_SetupGL's,
# outside it) and reads the frame's block, as GL's does.
#
# Run the SAME binary both ways, with identical settings; host_framerate holds
# game time, so the torch flames land alike run to run (sweep-mirror-gpu.steps
# explains it):
#
#   ./tools/mk-shadow-testgame.py <basedir>
#   A="-fsaa 0 +gamma 1 +host_framerate 0.000001 -game shadow +map demo2"
#   STEPS=tools/sweep-shadow-gpu.steps ENGINE=$E ./tools/headless-drive.sh script /tmp/sh-gl <basedir> $A
#   VK_ICD_FILENAMES=<lvp_icd json> VK_LAYER_PATH=<vulkan-validation-layers>/share/vulkan/explicit_layer.d \
#       VK_KHRONOS_VALIDATION_VALIDATE_SYNC=true VK_KHRONOS_VALIDATION_ENABLE_MESSAGE_LIMIT=false \
#       STEPS=tools/sweep-shadow-gpu.steps ENGINE=$E \
#       ./tools/headless-drive.sh script /tmp/sh-gpu <basedir> -gpu +gpu_allow_software 1 +gpu_debug 1 $A
#   ./tools/shadow-diff.sh /tmp/sh-gl /tmp/sh-gpu [/tmp/sh-gpu-master]
#
# The third directory, optional, is the same sweep under -gpu on the binary
# before P6b: frame 18 (r_dlight_occlusion 1) must be its 18 exactly.
#
# THE FRAMES, every one at r_dlight_occlusion 2, r_lightclusters 1 and
# r_shadow_casters 2 unless it says otherwise; the r_shadow_* cvars at their
# defaults (resolution 128, 8 lights, filter 1, 2 updates a frame, bias 1,
# the cache on).  The cameras are the leak check's:
#   01  lit: the torch at 170 312 80 on its own wall
#   02  scene 2: the torch at -758 482 192, a face in its PVS behind a wall,
#       and in the same view the recess barrel the torch's wall hides (the
#       leak check's scene 2 and alias boxes)
#   03  02 at r_shadow_casters 1
#   02o 02 at r_dlight_occlusion 1: the light through the wall, which only
#       the maps stop (the leak check: scene 2 FAILs at 1 by design)
#   04  cast: the free-standing torch at 120 250 32, the barrel between it
#       and the wall, r_shadow_casters 2: the barrel's shadow on the wall
#   05  04 at r_shadow_casters 1: the barrel casts nothing
#   06  04 with the barrel gone (r_entdist 150: the camera's distance to
#       the torch's flame is under it, the barrel's over), its map redrawn
#   07  04 at r_shadow_filter 0;  08  back at 1, so 08 must be 04 exactly
#   09  04 at r_shadow_resolution 64;  10  at 512
#   11  04 at r_shadow_maxlights 1
#   12  01 again at r_shadow_cache 0, every map redrawn each frame: 01
#       exactly (a static camera, so the cache is invisible)
#   13  04 at r_shadow_debug 1: slot 0 unwrapped into the corner, each
#       face's orientation and row order on screen
#   14  04 at r_alias_gpu 1, the instanced alias path's casters
#   17  04 at r_scale 0.5, with the post chain
#   18  04 at r_dlight_occlusion 1: no map drawn or read
# then demo2m:
#   15  04's view with the MD5 tombstone casting (a skeletal pose buffer)
#
# r_shadowinfo is printed after each frame (SI-<frame>), and renderer_status
# with it at 12 in the same console line, so the passes it counts are the
# ones that frame drew.
#
# THE REPORTS.  REPORT-BOOT holds the boot's gpu_unrouted; REPORT-ALL spans
# 01-18 on demo2 and REPORT-MAP 15 on demo2m, each reset at its start.
# tools/shadow-diff.sh's header has the checks and the thresholds.
#
# THE NUMBERS, measured 2026-11-28 at 800x600, llvmpipe GL (Mesa 26.2)
# against lavapipe -gpu with sync validation, runs 1-2 a side (run 3's PNGs
# were truncated by a full /tmp): every frame repeats itself exactly on each
# side (GL vs GL and -gpu vs -gpu 120 dB), so one number per frame:
#
#   frames                                  GL vs -gpu PSNR    gate
#   01 02 03 04-12 14 18                    71.7 - 76.6        42
#   13 (the debug view)                     71.9               50
#   17 (r_scale 0.5)                        82.8               42
#   15 (MD5 caster: the flame's phase)      51.5               42
#   02o (GL's frame is stale, see below)    42.4               42
#
# The leak boxes agree within 0.001 of luminance; r_shadowinfo 17 of 17
# identical; 12 = 01 and 08 = 04 exactly on both sides; 2 maps redrawn at 12,
# 12 layered passes.  02o on GL equals 02 in every loaded-box run (the frame
# X hands the harness is the one before the cvar), so "scene 2 stopped GL"
# fails there; the same steps on NVIDIA GL change 1460 pixels, as -gpu does.
#
# setpos is the server's, so every camera move is made unpaused.

sleep 20
cmd echo REPORT-BOOT-BEGIN
cmd gpu_unrouted
cmd echo REPORT-BOOT-END
cmd god
cmd notarget
cmd noclip
cmd con_notifytime 0
cmd viewsize 120
cmd crosshair 0
cmd showpause 0
cmd cl_bob 0
cmd cl_rollangle 0
cmd r_skyspeed_back 0
cmd r_skyspeed_front 0
cmd r_flatlightstyles 1
cmd r_dynamic 1
cmd gl_flashblend 0
cmd r_fullbright 0
cmd gl_torch_dlight 1
cmd r_lightclusters 1
cmd r_lightclusters_models 1
cmd r_gpulightstyles 1
cmd r_dlight_occlusion 2
cmd r_shadow_casters 2
cmd r_shadow_resolution 128
cmd r_shadow_maxlights 8
cmd r_shadow_filter 1
cmd r_shadow_updates 2
cmd r_shadow_bias 1
cmd r_shadow_cache 1
cmd r_shadow_debug 0
cmd r_entdist 0
cmd r_gpucull 0
cmd gl_hiz_cull 0
cmd r_ssao 0
cmd r_bloom 0
cmd r_hdr 0
cmd r_alias_gpu 0
cmd r_particles 0
cmd fog 0
cmd gl_texture_anisotropy 1
cmd r_oit 0
cmd r_waterwarp 0
cmd r_motionblur 0
cmd r_softparticles 0
cmd r_softemu 0
cmd r_scale 1
cmd gl_fxaa 0
cmd contrast 1
cmd gl_waterwarp_speed 0
cmd r_caustics 0
cmd gl_glows 0
cmd gl_missile_glows 0
cmd gl_other_glows 0
cmd r_drawviewmodel 0
cmd r_drawentities 1
cmd r_pp_time 10
sleep 2

cmd setpos 210 200 99 20 90 0
sleep 2
cmd gpu_unrouted reset
cmd echo REPORT-ALL-BEGIN
cmd pause
shot 01-lit
cmd echo SI-01; r_shadowinfo

cmd pause
cmd setpos -801 608 184 17 -90 0
sleep 2
cmd pause
shot 02-scene2
cmd echo SI-02; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_casters 1
shot 03-scene2-casters1
cmd echo SI-03; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_casters 2
cmd r_dlight_occlusion 1
shot 02o-scene2-occl1
cmd r_dlight_occlusion 2

cmd pause
cmd setpos 120 150 100 25 90 0
sleep 2
cmd pause
shot 04-cast2
cmd echo SI-04; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_casters 1
shot 05-cast1
cmd echo SI-05; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_casters 2
cmd r_entdist 150
shot 06-castbare
cmd echo SI-06; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_entdist 0
cmd r_shadow_filter 0
shot 07-filter0
cmd echo SI-07; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_filter 1
shot 08-filter1
cmd echo SI-08; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_resolution 64
shot 09-res64
cmd echo SI-09; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_resolution 512
shot 10-res512
cmd echo SI-10; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_resolution 128
cmd r_shadow_maxlights 1
shot 11-maxlights1
cmd echo SI-11; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_maxlights 8
cmd r_shadow_debug 1
shot 13-debug
cmd echo SI-13; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_shadow_debug 0
cmd r_alias_gpu 1
shot 14-aliasgpu
cmd echo SI-14; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_alias_gpu 0
cmd r_scale 0.5
shot 17-scale050
cmd echo SI-17; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_scale 1
cmd r_dlight_occlusion 1
shot 18-occl1
cmd echo SI-18; r_shadowinfo
cmd r_dlight_occlusion 2

cmd pause
cmd setpos 210 200 99 20 90 0
sleep 2
cmd pause
cmd r_shadow_cache 0
shot 12-nocache
cmd echo SI-12; r_shadowinfo; echo STATUS-12; renderer_status
cmd r_shadow_cache 1
cmd gpu_unrouted
cmd echo REPORT-ALL-END

cmd pause
console
enter map demo2m
sleep 25
cmd god
cmd noclip
cmd gpu_unrouted reset
cmd echo REPORT-MAP-BEGIN
cmd setpos 120 150 100 25 90 0
sleep 2
cmd pause
shot 15-md5cast
cmd echo SI-15; r_shadowinfo
cmd renderer_status
cmd gpu_unrouted
cmd echo REPORT-MAP-END
sleep 1
